							Line: "Wha.... i'm not a pussy erm... don't take offense tho",
							Song: "",
							Slot: 2
						},
						{
							Line: "A dandlion blows down stream to avoid the snows coming down from the North but come March fourth it will have returned. ",
							Song: "",
							Slot: 3
						},
						{
							Line: "Poetry is truly violence in words",
							Song: "",
							Slot: 4
						},
						{
							Line: "Yes my second name is Golum. Guac named me and he likes the letter G. Unsure why",
							Song: "",
							Slot: 5
						},
						{
							Line: "Brian has urinated on me more than once",
							Song: "",
							Slot: 6
						},
						{
							Line: "I tried pitching my play to Pete as he seems well spoken but all he talked about was his couch.",
